<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15096" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριστ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be best</i> or <i>bravest,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰὲν ἀριστεύειν καὶ ὑπείροχον
					ἔμμεναι ἄλλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.208
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὃς δέ κ᾽ ἀριστεύῃσι μάχῃ ἔνι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.409
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἀέθλοισιν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					11.14
				</span></i>
			; <i>gain the prize for valour</i> (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριστεῖα, τά</span>), <i>gain the highest distinction,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.55
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				9.105
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				468b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				9.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριστεύεσκε μάχεσθαι Τρώων</span>
			he <i>was the best</i> of the Trojans . . , <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				6.460
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.112
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.106
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὕνεκα βουλῇ ἀριστεύεσκεν ἁπάντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.627
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				10.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> c.
			inf., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριστεύεσκε μάχεσθαι</span>
			<i>he was best at</i> fighting, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				16.292
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				551
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριστεύεσκε μάχεσθαι
				Τρώων,</span>
			v. supr. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			c.acc.rei, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τι</span>
			<i>to be best in</i> a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στάδιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					10(11).64
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				13.43
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰάλεμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					15.98
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b> c. acc. cogn.,
				<i>win as</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριστεῖα, τὰ πρῶτα καλλιστεῖ᾽
					ἀριστεύσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					435
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1300
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντα ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					488
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				540a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεμιγμένην ἀριστείαν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Pel.</u>
					34
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of things,
				<i>to be best,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριστεύοισαν εὐκάρπου χθονός</span>
			<i>best of all lands</i> on fruitful earth, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				1.14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ κηδεῦσαι καθ᾽ ἑαυτὸν ἀριστεύει
					μακρῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					890
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); of an opinion, <i>prevail,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.144
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
